.SS "boolean animate (number deltaSeconds)"

.PP
Advance appearance and transform animation\&. Advances programmed movement, scheduled transitions, frame sequences, and animation helpers\&. Tween pause affects transitions and delays; constant rates still run\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIdeltaSeconds\fP Finite nonnegative elapsed time in seconds\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if the update changed animation values; false otherwise\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Advance a standalone object with animate(deltaSeconds)\&. \fBDrawing\fP and \fBElementRef\fP copy a sample of \fBAttributes\fP; use \fBElementRef\&.setLiveAttributes()\fP to follow later samples\&. MVC controllers advance their Views automatically\&.
